WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
This is a message from CDC.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.480
Dr. Fernando Stein, President of the American Academy of

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.360
Pediatrics. Carbon monoxide is a gas you cannot see

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.540
or smell, but it can make you sick or

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.540
kill you. Symptoms of carbon monoxide poisoning include headaches,

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.920
dizziness, vomiting or confusion.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:22.300
Only use gasoline or diesel engines outside, more than

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.580
20 feet away from any home, door, window or

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.620
vent. If you suspect this poisoning, go outside and

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.260
call 911.
